config-tickets-waiting_after_hours = After a staff reply, move a text-channel ticket to its waiting category after this many hours; 0 disables it.
config-tickets-first_response_timeout_hours = Close a ticket if no staff member sends a human reply within this many hours after opening; 0 disables it.
config-tickets-last_message_timeout_hours = Close a ticket after this many hours without a human message; bot and webhook messages do not reset the timer. 0 disables it.
config-tickets-waiting_category = Category for text-channel tickets waiting after a staff reply; leave unset to keep the current category. Threads are not moved.
config-tickets-panel-waiting_after_hours = Waiting delay for this panel; 0 disables it and does not inherit the server setting.
config-tickets-panel-first_response_timeout_hours = First staff reply timeout for this panel; 0 disables it and does not inherit the server setting.
config-tickets-panel-last_message_timeout_hours = Inactivity timeout for this panel; 0 disables it and does not inherit the server setting.
config-tickets-panel-waiting_category = Waiting category for text-channel tickets from this panel; unset disables the move and does not inherit the server setting. Threads are not moved.
config-tickets-integrations = Configure up to 20 integrations for ticket-open requests and dynamic form choices. Store secrets in the per-server encrypted write-only vault; values are never returned.
config-tickets-integration-id = Unique ID using 1–32 lowercase letters or numbers.
config-tickets-integration-url = Fixed HTTPS URL for a public host. Supported query placeholders are allowed; fragments and embedded credentials are not. The host is checked at request time.
config-tickets-integration-auth = Authentication mode: none, bearer, or api_key. Credentials use the per-server encrypted write-only vault; only configured status is shown, never secret values.
config-tickets-form-dynamic-options = Load selectable form choices from an integration. Responses must provide 1–25 choices.
config-tickets-form-dynamic-options-integration = ID of the integration to call.
config-tickets-form-dynamic-options-items_pointer = JSON Pointer to the choices array; leave blank when the response itself is an array.
config-tickets-form-dynamic-options-label_pointer = JSON Pointer to each choice's label.
config-tickets-form-dynamic-options-value_pointer = JSON Pointer to each choice's stored value.
config-tickets-form-dynamic-options-description_pointer = Optional JSON Pointer to each choice's description.
tickets-form-options-too-many = The integration returned more than 25 choices. Ask a server administrator to reduce the list.
tickets-form-options-unavailable = Could not load the form choices. Try again later.

